Your Troubleshooting Checklist
When you get a ticket:

Gather Info: Customer deployment size, version, issue timeline, error messages
Check Alarms: Grid Manager → Dashboard → current alerts?
Review Logs: Collect logs for affected timeframe (Grid Manager → Support → Logs)
Verify Health: All nodes online? All sites connected? Metrics normal?
Isolate Scope: Is it config, performance, replication, or a bug?
Test: Use simulation tools (ILM sim, S3 test connections)
Document: Always capture reproduce steps and resolution for future reference
